A minor figure of the Hold, known to carry Item-Omega on patrol.

## NPC-Rho
A minor figure of the Hold, known to carry Item-Rho on patrol.

## Item-Sigma
A trinket of the Hold. Origin: Place-Zeta.

## Item-Tau
A trinket of the Hold. Origin: Place-Eta.

## Item-Upsilon
A trinket of the Hold. Origin: Place-Theta.

