  "outputs": {
    "chronicle": "Passage 8730e6612702 (1). PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. Steel rang on stone and the corridor filled with the smell of old rain and iron. PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. Steel rang on stone and the corridor filled with the smell of old rain and iron. Under the Place-Delta sky, PC-Alpha pressed the matter while PC-Beta watched the road. Steel rang on stone and the corridor filled with the smell of old rain and iron. They went on, slower now, each of them listening for the next sound in the dark. They went on, slower now, each of them listening for the next sound in the dark.

Passage 49ca30305887 (2). PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. Steel rang on stone and the corridor filled with the smell of old rain and iron. By the third bell they had settled on a plan and nobody liked it. By the third bell they had settled on a plan and nobody liked it.",
