  "outputs": {
    "chronicle": "Passage 98836f7f02e1 (1). The torches of Place-Delta guttered as NPC-Gamma weighed the party in silence. Nobody laughed this time; the table had gone quiet around the dice. The torches of Place-Delta guttered as NPC-Gamma weighed the party in silence. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. The torches of Place-Delta guttered as NPC-Gamma weighed the party in silence. Nobody laughed this time; the table had gone quiet around the dice. By the third bell they had settled on a plan and nobody liked it. By the third bell they had settled on a plan and nobody liked it.

Passage 81db8cb7b045 (2). PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. Under the Place-Delta sky, PC-Alpha pressed the matter while PC-Beta watched the road. Steel rang on stone and the corridor filled with the smell of old rain and iron. By the third bell they had settled on a plan and nobody liked it. They went on, slower now, each of them listening for the next sound in the dark.",
    "condensed": {
      "bulletPoints": [
        "98a7745039f8: The party entered Place-Delta.",
        "98a7745039f8: NPC-Gamma warned them about Item-Epsilon.",
        "98a7745039f8: A sentry fell from the wall.",
      ],
      "narrative": "Condensed 98a7745039f8: the party crossed Place-Delta under NPC-Gamma's watch, carrying Item-Epsilon through the gate. Steel was drawn, a sentry fell, and they pressed on into the dark with a plan nobody liked and everybody followed.",
    },
