  "outputs": {
    "chronicle": "Passage 09f2f27e6da0 (1). The torches of Place-Delta guttered as NPC-Gamma weighed the party in silence. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. A sentry fell from the wall and the courtyard answered with a long, ragged shout. PC-Kappa gathered the humming Item-Epsilon close and spoke a low word of warding. Steel rang on stone and the corridor filled with the smell of old rain and iron. They went on, slower now, each of them listening for the next sound in the dark. They went on, slower now, each of them listening for the next sound in the dark.",
    "condensed": {
      "bulletPoints": [
        "279b02aa8b0b: The party entered Place-Delta.",
        "279b02aa8b0b: NPC-Gamma warned them about Item-Epsilon.",
        "279b02aa8b0b: A sentry fell from the wall.",
      ],
      "narrative": "Condensed 279b02aa8b0b: the party crossed Place-Delta under NPC-Gamma's watch, carrying Item-Epsilon through the gate. Steel was drawn, a sentry fell, and they pressed on into the dark with a plan nobody liked and everybody followed.",
    },
    "dmAnswers": {
      "q-1-1": "Golden answer 1 for q-1-1.",
      "q-2-1": "Golden answer 2 for q-2-1.",
    },
    "extras": {
