[PC-Beta (Player)] So here is what I think we do. We go back up through Place-Delta, we lock the gate behind us, and we let NPC-Gamma come to us instead of walking into the dark carrying Item-Epsilon like a lantern. If the plan works we get the high ground, and if it does not, well, at least we die near the exit. If the plan works we get the high ground, and if it does not, well, at least we die near the exit.
